            "source_snapshot_id": "harbor-source-a",
            "block_id": "statement",
            "text": "Harbor Grid Systems. An illustrative worksheet repeats Gross profit 27 27 and is not the reported table. Consolidated annual statements, USD millions. FY2022: January 1 through December 31, 2022. FY2021: January 1 through December 31, 2021. Columns: FY2022 FY2021.\nGross profit 27 27\nResearch and development expense 27 27\nReported operating cash flow 18 17\nAdjusted operating cash flow 22 19",
            "text_hash": "98788afda1590dc82c8cd8f6f6e3ccff62401d2ac025f4df5b5189af40613f9f"
          },
          {
            "source_snapshot_id": "harbor-source-a",
            "block_id": "notes",
            "text": "Note 5. For FY2022, adjusted operating cash flow removes the effect of USD 4 million of one-time environmental remediation payments already included in reported operating cash outflows. Add back those payments to reported operating cash flow: 18 + 4 = 22 (USD millions). There are no other FY2022 adjustments to this measure. The issuer does not provide other companies' non-GAAP definitions in this excerpt.",
            "text_hash": "616eb5ca4ff08d8ae1868bbba1ae5febe2141b98f683a5c95e8b30c1c592c0a0"
          }
